('NL:data-engineer','2026-08-12',null,19.43,38400,15,0,0,0,10,6,0,3,5,39,'career-opportunity-nl-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','Data Engineer spans software, database and platform engineering; no exact legacy ISCO-08 unit group is forced.','shortage_note','UWV continues to report strong demand for higher-skilled ICT specialists, database specialists and analysts; this is used as a conservative data-engineering proxy; 15/20.','visa_basis','No data-engineer-specific Dutch migration fast track. Standard Highly Skilled Migrant rules apply where sponsor and salary criteria are met; 3/10.','salary_method','Studiekeuze123 HBO Informatica/HBO-ICT estimated starting salary EUR 3,200/month, annualised to EUR 38,400; 6/10.','entry_basis','Higher-education informatics/data study plus database, programming and platform skills is the common route; 10/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory Data Engineer registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-12'),
('NL:cybersecurity-analyst','2026-08-12',null,19.43,38400,20,0,0,0,10,6,0,3,5,44,'career-opportunity-nl-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ISCO-08 2529 Database and Network Professionals n.e.c., constrained to cybersecurity analysis/security-specialist scope.','shortage_note','UWV explicitly identifies cybersecurity experts/security specialists among significantly demanded and structurally promising ICT roles; 20/20.','visa_basis','Cybersecurity has no occupation-list immigration fast track. Highly Skilled Migrant access still requires a recognised sponsor and applicable salary/market-rate conditions; 3/10.','salary_method','Studiekeuze123 HBO-ICT estimated starting salary EUR 3,200/month, annualised to EUR 38,400 and used as a transparent cyber/ICT graduate proxy; 6/10.','entry_basis','HBO-ICT Cyber Security & Cloud and related informatics/security study provide the standard higher-education route; 10/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory cybersecurity register; sector screening or clearance may apply; 5/5.'),'2026-08-12'),
('NL:network-administrator','2026-08-12',null,19.43,38400,15,0,0,0,12,6,0,3,5,41,'career-opportunity-nl-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ISCO-08 2523 Computer Network Professionals, network-administration scope.','shortage_note','UWV lists network administrators, technical-infrastructure specialists and network engineers among structurally promising ICT occupations, although current ICT tightness is easing; 15/20.','visa_basis','No network-administrator-specific immigration route; recognised-sponsor and salary requirements remain decisive for Highly Skilled Migrant access; 3/10.','salary_method','Studiekeuze123 HBO-ICT/Informatica estimated starting salary EUR 3,200/month, annualised to EUR 38,400 as an infrastructure-role proxy; 6/10.','entry_basis','HBO-ICT, Informatica and associate-degree ICT routes can lead to network administration, with vendor skills often layered on; 12/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory Network Administrator register; 5/5.'),'2026-08-12'),
('NL:cloud-engineer','2026-08-12',null,19.43,38400,15,0,0,0,10,6,0,3,5,39,'career-opportunity-nl-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','Cloud Engineer / DevOps infrastructure is a modern cross-cutting role with no exact ISCO-08 unit group forced.','shortage_note','Current UWV evidence supports continuing demand for specialist ICT infrastructure, network and security expertise; cloud demand is scored conservatively as a specialist-infrastructure proxy; 15/20.','visa_basis','No cloud-engineer-specific migration fast track. Highly Skilled Migrant eligibility remains dependent on recognised sponsor and current salary criteria; 3/10.','salary_method','Studiekeuze123 HBO-ICT estimated starting salary EUR 3,200/month, annualised to EUR 38,400; 6/10.','entry_basis','HBO-ICT Cyber Security & Cloud/infrastructure study plus automation and platform skills is a common route; 10/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory Cloud Engineer registration; vendor certifications are optional/employer-specific; 5/5.'),'2026-08-12'),
